      "text": "fowls … Are ye not much better than they, Matt. 6:26. How much then is a man better than a sheep, Matt. 12:12. to be with Christ; which is far better, Philip. 1:23. let each esteem other better than themselves, Philip. 2:3. Being made so much better than the angels, Heb. 1:4. was Jesus made a surety of a better testament, Heb. 7:22. mediator of a better covenant, which was established upon better promises, Heb. 8:6. purified … the heavenly things themselves with better sacrifices than these, Heb. 9:23. ye have in heaven a better and an enduring substance, Heb. 10:34. desire a better country, that is, an heavenly, Heb. 11:16. blood of sprinkling, that speaketh better things than that of Abel, Heb. 12:24. had been better for them not to have known, 2 Pet. 2:21.",
